  "id": "christmas-pudding-vodka",
  "name": "Christmas Pudding Vodka",
  "subtitle": "A fruit-studded, warmly spiced vodka infusion",
  "description": "Dried fruit, citrus zest, brown sugar, and baking spices give vodka a festive pudding-inspired character, rounded out with brandy and amaretto.",
